00:32:46.720 --> 00:32:52.560
The forest once stretched unbroken from the west coast of Africa all the way to the Indian

00:32:52.560 --> 00:32:59.720
Ocean.

00:32:59.720 --> 00:33:04.200
But as we travel east, the scene is very different.

00:33:04.200 --> 00:33:10.040
The forests now give way to frozen summits.

00:33:10.040 --> 00:33:19.000
Up here lies the largest glacier in Africa, only a few miles north of the equator.

00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:27.520
