00:33:27.520 --> 00:33:45.480
It separates the ancient jungles from what is now savanna in the east.

00:33:45.480 --> 00:34:01.160
Below the highlands, vast wetlands cut swathes through the open savanna.

00:34:01.160 --> 00:34:16.840
The Anguilo swamp is huge, its name means where the water meets the sky.

00:34:16.840 --> 00:34:39.480
Hidden amongst this maze of waterways is a creature like no other.

00:34:39.480 --> 00:34:53.960
A giant prehistoric looking bird.

00:34:53.960 --> 00:34:58.920
A shoebill.

00:34:58.920 --> 00:35:13.480
Standing well over a meter tall, she roams these swamps, trying to catch catfish.

00:35:13.480 --> 00:35:41.200
Not exactly what she was after.

00:35:41.200 --> 00:35:51.440
Further into the swamp lies the reason for all this fishing.

00:35:51.440 --> 00:35:58.680
This chick is just three weeks old and a little bit wobbly on its feet.

00:35:58.680 --> 00:36:02.040
Its vast bill means it has trouble balancing.

00:36:02.040 --> 00:36:11.040
It won't be able to fly or even walk properly for several weeks.

00:36:11.040 --> 00:36:25.680
It's entirely reliant on its parents for food and water.

00:36:25.680 --> 00:36:40.800
There is also a smaller chick who isn't doing so well.

00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:50.800
