00:36:58.480 --> 00:37:22.760
It's three days older than the other chick and has always won the race for food and attention.

00:37:22.760 --> 00:37:32.160
This is more than just a scrap between two siblings.

00:37:32.160 --> 00:37:46.880
As their mother returns, she sees what the larger chick has done.

00:37:46.880 --> 00:38:08.160
The smaller chick seeks its mother's comfort, but she has already made her choice.

00:38:08.160 --> 00:38:21.280
Only her firstborn will get a drink.

00:38:21.280 --> 00:38:31.040
