00:38:31.040 --> 00:38:47.840
The younger chick was only ever an insurance in case the elder didn't make it.

00:38:47.840 --> 00:38:52.340
Now it's old enough, the adults know that they're better off putting all their efforts

00:38:52.340 --> 00:39:00.960
into bringing up just one fit and healthy youngster.

00:39:00.960 --> 00:39:06.440
The swamps changing water levels mean fishing is too unpredictable for them to gamble on

00:39:06.440 --> 00:39:15.800
trying to raise two chicks.

00:39:15.800 --> 00:39:41.680
It's everywhere in East Africa.

00:39:41.680 --> 00:39:59.080
Volcanic eruptions and fires periodically devastate the land.

00:39:59.080 --> 00:40:04.960
But after destruction comes regeneration.

00:40:04.960 --> 00:40:15.360
Here in the savannah, strewn with fertile ash, that means lush green grass.

00:40:15.360 --> 00:40:21.280
Today savannahs dominate the landscape of this vast continent.

00:40:21.280 --> 00:40:27.320
They're also one of the most productive on earth.

00:40:27.320 --> 00:40:50.480
Of the grasses come animals in huge numbers.

00:40:50.480 --> 00:41:08.760
Shadowed by hunters of every size.

00:41:08.760 --> 00:41:15.400
With the herds come flying insects, billions of them.

00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:33.480
Foo, if only they could catch them.

00:41:33.480 --> 00:41:56.560
Time for a rethink.

00:41:56.560 --> 00:42:12.480
This agama lizard has spotted an opportunity.

00:42:12.480 --> 00:42:18.640
Only one thing attracts more flies than the wildebeest.

00:42:18.640 --> 00:42:27.600
Lions that have eaten wildebeest.

00:42:27.600 --> 00:42:29.680
